# Editing a canvas: one item moves or changes colour per command; the ESP redraws the rest.
include setup
prompt
eval 2 40 18 48 UI-SURFACE\n5 2 160 40 40 18 UI-VISIBLE UI-DECOR OR UI-SHADOW OR UI-WINDOW\nS" Sales" 5 UI-TITLE\n3 2 0 0 320 144 3 UI-CV-VISIBLE UI-CANVAS\n3 0 UI-PEN  0 10 130 300 130 UI-LINE\n3 4 UI-PEN  1 30 100 30 30 UI-BAR  2 90 100 30 30 UI-BAR  3 150 100 30 30 UI-BAR\n3 0 UI-PEN  S" Q1     Q2     Q3" 5 30 134 UI-PRINT\nUI-COMMIT
focus 5
frame 700
eval 3 4 UI-PEN 1 30 92 30 38 UI-BAR 2 90 96 30 34 UI-BAR 3 150 89 30 41 UI-BAR UI-COMMIT
frame 160
eval 3 4 UI-PEN 1 30 84 30 46 UI-BAR 2 90 92 30 38 UI-BAR 3 150 78 30 52 UI-BAR UI-COMMIT
frame 160
eval 3 4 UI-PEN 1 30 76 30 54 UI-BAR 2 90 88 30 42 UI-BAR 3 150 67 30 63 UI-BAR UI-COMMIT
frame 160
eval 3 4 UI-PEN 1 30 68 30 62 UI-BAR 2 90 84 30 46 UI-BAR 3 150 56 30 74 UI-BAR UI-COMMIT
frame 160
eval 3 4 UI-PEN 1 30 60 30 70 UI-BAR 2 90 80 30 50 UI-BAR 3 150 45 30 85 UI-BAR UI-COMMIT
frame 160
eval 3 4 UI-PEN 1 30 52 30 78 UI-BAR 2 90 76 30 54 UI-BAR 3 150 34 30 96 UI-BAR UI-COMMIT
frame 160
eval 3 4 UI-PEN 1 30 44 30 86 UI-BAR 2 90 72 30 58 UI-BAR 3 150 23 30 107 UI-BAR UI-COMMIT
frame 160
eval 3 4 UI-PEN 1 30 36 30 94 UI-BAR 2 90 68 30 62 UI-BAR 3 150 23 30 107 UI-BAR UI-COMMIT
frame 160
eval 3 12 UI-INK UI-COMMIT
frame 900
eval 3 0 UI-PEN 6 200 20 60 60 UI-OVAL UI-COMMIT
frame 300
eval 6 0 6 UI-NUDGE 6 6 0 UI-NUDGE UI-COMMIT
frame 160
eval 6 0 6 UI-NUDGE 6 6 0 UI-NUDGE UI-COMMIT
frame 160
eval 6 0 6 UI-NUDGE 6 6 0 UI-NUDGE UI-COMMIT
frame 160
eval 6 0 6 UI-NUDGE 6 6 0 UI-NUDGE UI-COMMIT
frame 160
eval 6 0 6 UI-NUDGE 6 6 0 UI-NUDGE UI-COMMIT
frame 160
eval 6 0 6 UI-NUDGE 6 6 0 UI-NUDGE UI-COMMIT
frame 160
frame 1500
